# To-Do List Application

A simple command-line To-Do List application developed in Python. It allows users to add, view, search, and delete tasks while storing them permanently in a text file using Python file handling.

## Features

- Add new tasks
- View all tasks
- Delete tasks
- Search tasks by keyword
- Persistent storage using `tasks.txt`
- Simple command-line interface

## Technologies Used

- Python 3
- File Handling
- OS Module

